Though we use serviceSpec, we have the option of ignoring fields we think should not be used. For example selector. That seems obvious. clusterIP i think can be exposed if the user knows what they are doing. 
Even sessionAffinity for example can be exposed but is an overkill for a single pod sandbox. 

@justinsb WDYT ? 
@janetkuo  FYI.

